          "text": "C2 gives the ordinary Frechet chain rule Dw[v]=-w inner(gradientU,v). Apply full-space directional integration by parts to w and the constant1. All three required integrable products have been derived; the constant derivative is zero. No pointwise boundary-value or cutoff condition is assumed.",
          "formula": "Dw(x)[v]=-w(x)\\langle\\nabla U(x),v\\rangle,\\quad\\int w\\langle\\nabla U,v\\rangle dx=0.",
